[9.201, "o", "# Release readiness: product `rr-product-38143-8095`\r\n\r\nGenerated: 2026-08-29T17:55:06Z\r\n\r\n## Scope and rules\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** Product scope; collection started 2026-08-29T17:55:06Z and ended 2026-08-29T17:55:15Z; 3 visible bugs (#72, #73, #74); bounded rolling collection.\r\n- **Assumption:** `RESOLVED` and `CLOSED` are complete; `Highest` priority or `release-blocker` whiteboard text is blocking; stale means changed before 2026-07-30T17:55:06Z (30 days before `as-of`); time zone is UTC.\r\n- **Fact:** Authorization can hide bugs, so this report does not claim an unobservable total.\r\n\r\n## Readiness assessment\r\n\r\n- **Assessment:** not ready.\r\n- **Fact:** 1/3 visible bugs match a configured blocker (#74).\r\n\r\n## Blockers\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** #74 is open with `Highest` priority and the configured whiteboard marker.\r\n\r\n## Dependency risks\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** 1 unresolved outgoing dependency (#72) blocks #74.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Stale or unowned work\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** 0 stale and 0 unowned open bugs under the stated assumptions.\r\n\r\n## Recent adverse changes\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** #74 has 1 visible status-change record since 2020-01-01.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Decisions needed\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Assessment:** Decide whether #74 can be cleared and whether dependency #72 must close before the release proceeds.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Data limitations\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Fact:** Rolling snapshot, visible rows only; custom fields observed: 0; no custom-field rule was assumed.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Source commands\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "```text\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> bug search --from-url <credential-free-url> --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> query show release-readiness-demo --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> query run release-readiness-demo --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> bug list --product rr-product-38143-8095 --target-milestone --- --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> bug list --version rr-version-38143-24934 --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,prior"]
[0.000, "o", "ity,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> bug list --product rr-product-38143-8095 --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> bug view 74 --json --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> bug history 74 --since 2020-01-01 --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> bug links 74 --relation depends_on --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> field list status --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> server capabilities --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> schema bug\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Evidence appendix\r\n\r\n"]
